WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:04.300
This is HASTE, High-speed Assessment and Satellite Tracking for

00:04.320 --> 00:06.300
Emergencies, an open-source

00:06.320 --> 00:08.850
toolkit from Microsoft AI for Good.

00:10.700 --> 00:15.080
On August 1, 2026, the Old Trails Fire tore through

00:15.100 --> 00:18.250
neighborhoods on the northwest side of Spokane, Washington.

00:18.860 --> 00:21.900
It destroyed more than 640 structures and

00:21.920 --> 00:24.750
forced over 60,000 people to evacuate.

00:25.260 --> 00:27.860
In the days after a disaster like this, responders

00:27.880 --> 00:31.130
need to know, which buildings were hit and how many?
